        "title": "Comparative Politics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Comparative politics asks: why do political systems look different, and with what\nconsequences? Electoral systems, regime types, state capacity, and institutional\ndesign all produce systematically different political and policy outcomes."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-COMPARATIVE-POLITICS.md#003",
